        "quote": "The purpose of this chapter is to enhance, protect, and promote the aesthetic, ecological, and economic environment in the City of Topeka through landscaping associated with new construction. Landscaping achieves the following goals:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "72868048-f771-5527-8079-9381fb215ed7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 283,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:1",
          "start": 234
        },
        "quote": "(a) Preserves and enhances Topeka’s urban forest;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "3658d2f0-dc4b-5cb6-a115-8439884c4466",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 384,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:2",
          "start": 284
        },
        "quote": "(b) Promotes the reestablishment of vegetation in urban areas for health and urban wildlife reasons;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "572d3db2-2c08-5955-86af-5cf3b477de0c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 479,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:3",
          "start": 385
        },
        "quote": "(c) Establishes and enhances a visual character which recognizes aesthetics and safety issues;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b596c697-4f67-50ef-8198-47cd1f185acf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 650,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:4",
          "start": 480
        },
        "quote": "(d) Promotes the compatibility between land uses by reducing the visual, noise, and lighting impacts of specific development on users of the site and abutting properties;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
